---
description: SENTINEL stays a defensive investigation tool
globs: backend/**/*.py,frontend/**/*.{ts,tsx}
---

SENTINEL explains logs. Findings, graph edges, and report statements must cite parsed event ids. Do not add exploit code, payloads, scanners, or vulnerability-validation attacks. Recommendations stay containment and recovery: block an address, disable an account, isolate a host, review a group, preserve the cited events.
